{
 "info": {
  "name": "Decidiq Records Management Contract Suite",
  "description": "Wire contract of the archival dossier and its disposition (openspec/changes/records-management-archiving):\n\n  POST /api/meetings/{meetingId}/archival-dossier  archivalDossier#form          401 / 403 (not chair, secretary or admin) / 404 / 201 forming, one per meeting\n  POST /api/dossiers/{id}/assemble                 archivalDossier#assemble      200 forming / 409 frozen\n  POST /api/dossiers/{id}/close                    archivalDossier#close         403 / 422 gaps without a reason / 200 closed with the reason / 409 frozen\n  GET  /api/dossiers/{id}/disposition              dossierDisposition#show       401 / 403 before 404 / 404 / 200 route, category, overridden\n  POST /api/dossiers/{id}/disposition              dossierDisposition#propose    409 not-closed\n  POST /api/dossiers/{id}/outcome                  dossierDisposition#outcome    403\n  POST /api/dossiers/{id}/certificate              dossierDisposition#certificate 403\n  PUT  /api/dossiers/{id}/category                 dossierDisposition#category   403 / 422 no-category / 200 own category routes to destruction / the schema's category clears it\n\nAn archivist is a member of OpenRegister's `archivaris` group; the suite creates the group when it is missing and leaves it in place. It never hands a dossier to an OpenRegister list, so it writes no transfer or destruction list. Self-contained and idempotent: it seeds a member and an archivist probe user and a meeting that is not closed, and deletes them and the dossier in teardown. Written, not run: it needs a live instance.\n\n@spec openspec/changes/records-management-archiving/specs/records-management-archiving/spec.md\n\nSPDX-License-Identifier: EUPL-1.2\nSPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 Conduction B.V. <info@conduction.nl>",
  "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
 },
 "auth": {
  "type": "noauth"
 },
